@startuml Saga Chorégraphiée - Architecture Minimale + Outbox Pattern
title Saga Chorégraphiée - Architecture Minimale + Outbox Pattern\nChaque service réagit aux événements Kafka de façon autonome — aucun appel REST inter-services\nAliases hardcodés dans AliasRegistry.java

actor "Client / Payeur" as Client
participant "API Gateway\n(KrakenD)\n:8080" as Gateway
participant "Payment\nOrchestration\n:8083" as Payment
participant "payment_outbox_event\n(MySQL)" as PaymentOutbox
participant "PaymentOutbox\nPublisher\n@Scheduled 500ms" as PaymentPoller
participant "Kafka\nBroker" as Kafka
participant "Clearing &\nSettlement\n:8084" as Settlement
participant "settlement_outbox_event\n(MySQL)" as ClearingOutbox
participant "ClearingOutbox\nPublisher\n@Scheduled 500ms" as ClearingPoller
participant "ledger_entry\n(Immutable)" as Ledger

== Phase 1: Initier le paiement ==
Client -> Gateway: POST /api/payment/initiate\n{alias, amount, idempotencyKey}

activate Gateway
Gateway -> Payment: Route vers Payment Service
activate Payment

Payment -> Payment: Idempotency Check (Redis)
alt Cache Hit
    Payment --> Gateway: 200 OK (réponse cachée)
else Cache Miss
    Payment -> Payment: Resolve alias\n(AliasRegistry en mémoire)
    note right of Payment
        Aliases hardcodés
        directement dans
        AliasRegistry.java
        (Map<String, AliasEntry>)
        — aucun YAML, aucune DB
    end note

    Payment -> Payment: ── TRANSACTION ATOMIQUE ──
    Payment -> Payment: INSERT payment\n{id, idempotencyKey, status=INITIATED}
    Payment -> PaymentOutbox: INSERT payment_outbox_event\n{eventType="payment.initiated", published=false}
    Payment -> Payment: ── COMMIT ──

    Payment -> Payment: Cache dans Redis\n(idempotencyKey → paymentId, TTL 24h)
    Payment --> Gateway: 201 Created\n{paymentId, status=INITIATED}
end

deactivate Payment
Gateway --> Client: {paymentId, status=INITIATED}
deactivate Gateway

== Outbox: publier payment.initiated ==
PaymentPoller -> PaymentOutbox: SELECT WHERE published=false
activate PaymentPoller
PaymentOutbox --> PaymentPoller: [payment.initiated row]
PaymentPoller -> Kafka: send("payment.initiated", paymentId, payload)
activate Kafka
Kafka --> PaymentPoller: ACK
deactivate Kafka
PaymentPoller -> PaymentOutbox: UPDATE published=true, publishedAt=now()
deactivate PaymentPoller

== Phase 2: Débit Bank A (interne) ==
Kafka -> Payment: consume payment.initiated
activate Payment
Payment -> Payment: [Bank A] Débit Alice: -100 CAD
Payment -> Payment: ── TRANSACTION ATOMIQUE ──
Payment -> Payment: UPDATE payment SET status=DEBIT_REQUESTED
Payment -> PaymentOutbox: INSERT payment_outbox_event\n{eventType="payment.debit_requested", published=false}
Payment -> Payment: ── COMMIT ──
deactivate Payment

PaymentPoller -> PaymentOutbox: SELECT WHERE published=false
activate PaymentPoller
PaymentPoller -> Kafka: send("payment.debit_requested", paymentId, payload)
PaymentPoller -> PaymentOutbox: UPDATE published=true
deactivate PaymentPoller

== Phase 3: Crédit Bank B (interne) ==
Kafka -> Payment: consume payment.debit_requested
activate Payment
Payment -> Payment: [Bank B] Crédit Bob: +100 CAD
Payment -> Payment: ── TRANSACTION ATOMIQUE ──
Payment -> Payment: UPDATE payment SET status=CREDIT_REQUESTED
Payment -> PaymentOutbox: INSERT payment_outbox_event\n{eventType="payment.credit_requested", published=false}
Payment -> Payment: ── COMMIT ──
deactivate Payment

PaymentPoller -> PaymentOutbox: SELECT WHERE published=false
activate PaymentPoller
PaymentPoller -> Kafka: send("payment.credit_requested", paymentId, payload)
PaymentPoller -> PaymentOutbox: UPDATE published=true
deactivate PaymentPoller

== Phase 4: Déclencher le règlement ==
Kafka -> Payment: consume payment.credit_requested
activate Payment
Payment -> Payment: ── TRANSACTION ATOMIQUE ──
Payment -> Payment: UPDATE payment SET status=SETTLEMENT_TRIGGERED
Payment -> PaymentOutbox: INSERT payment_outbox_event\n{eventType="payment.settlement_triggered", published=false}
Payment -> Payment: ── COMMIT ──
deactivate Payment

PaymentPoller -> PaymentOutbox: SELECT WHERE published=false
activate PaymentPoller
PaymentPoller -> Kafka: send("payment.settlement_triggered", paymentId, payload)
PaymentPoller -> PaymentOutbox: UPDATE published=true
deactivate PaymentPoller

== Phase 5: Enregistrer le ledger immuable ==
Kafka -> Settlement: consume payment.settlement_triggered
activate Settlement
Settlement -> Settlement: Valider les prérequis

Settlement -> Settlement: ── TRANSACTION ATOMIQUE ──
Settlement -> Ledger: INSERT ledger_entry (DEBIT)\nparticipantId=BankA, amount=100, hash=SHA256(...)
activate Ledger
Ledger --> Settlement: Appended (immutable)
Settlement -> Ledger: INSERT ledger_entry (CREDIT)\nparticipantId=BankB, amount=100, hash=SHA256(...)
Ledger --> Settlement: Appended (immutable)
deactivate Ledger
Settlement -> Settlement: Valider: SUM(DEBIT) = SUM(CREDIT)
Settlement -> ClearingOutbox: INSERT settlement_outbox_event\n{eventType="clearing.settlement_confirmed", published=false}
Settlement -> Settlement: ── COMMIT ──
deactivate Settlement

== Outbox: publier clearing.settlement_confirmed ==
ClearingPoller -> ClearingOutbox: SELECT WHERE published=false
activate ClearingPoller
ClearingOutbox --> ClearingPoller: [clearing.settlement_confirmed row]
ClearingPoller -> Kafka: send("clearing.settlement_confirmed", paymentId, payload)
activate Kafka
Kafka --> ClearingPoller: ACK
deactivate Kafka
ClearingPoller -> ClearingOutbox: UPDATE published=true, publishedAt=now()
deactivate ClearingPoller

== Phase 6: Finaliser le paiement ==
Kafka -> Payment: consume clearing.settlement_confirmed
activate Payment
Payment -> Payment: ── TRANSACTION ATOMIQUE ──
Payment -> Payment: UPDATE payment SET status=SETTLED, settledAt=now()
Payment -> PaymentOutbox: INSERT payment_outbox_event\n{eventType="payment.settled", published=false}
Payment -> Payment: ── COMMIT ──
deactivate Payment

PaymentPoller -> PaymentOutbox: SELECT WHERE published=false
activate PaymentPoller
PaymentPoller -> Kafka: send("payment.settled", paymentId, payload)
PaymentPoller -> PaymentOutbox: UPDATE published=true
deactivate PaymentPoller

== État Final ==
note over Client, Ledger
  ÉTAT FINAL (IMMUABLE):
  Payment Status: SETTLED
  Alice Balance: -100 CAD (final)
  Bob Balance: +100 CAD (final)
  BC Ledger: DEBIT = CREDIT (append-only, SHA256)
  Durée: ~1000-1500ms
  Garantie: Exactly-Once
    → Idempotency key (Redis 24h)
    → Outbox at-least-once Kafka
    → Consumer idempotent
end note

@enduml
